{"sections":[{"slug":"vonNeumann代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"vonNeumann代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“von Neumann <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“von Neumann 代数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">抽象定义</span></h3>\n<p>von Neumann <span lang=\"zh\">代数是有预对偶的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/C-星代数","text":"C-<span lang=\"zh\">星代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">具体定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> ($\\mathbb{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hilbert空间","text":"Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathcal B(H)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的有界算子的代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> von Neumann <span lang=\"zh\">代数为</span> $\\mathcal B(H)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子代数</span> $N$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$N$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于运算</span> $*$ <span lang=\"zh\">封闭</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal B(H)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $*$-<span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在弱算子拓扑下是闭的</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">弱算子拓扑是使得对任意</span> $x,y\\in H$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $T\\mapsto \\langle Tx,y\\rangle$ <span lang=\"zh\">都连续的最弱拓扑</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是局部紧群</span>. $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用在</span> $L^2(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>,</p>\n"}]}}}]}